{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-oracle-program-semantics.md","title":"Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","display":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","aliases":["73-df-oracle-program-semantics","73-df-oracle-turing-machine"],"display":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-oracle-program-semantics</span><span>73-df-oracle-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；方向符号、位移 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 和带更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\">\\(\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>。表格按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\">\\((q,a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\\)</span> 的数值字典序排列，表头和每条转移字段的排列保留原接口。</li>\n<li>在结构谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanonOTM}\">\\(\\operatorname{CanonOTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTableCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{OTableCode}\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 为候选程序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。程序结构不依赖神谕集合的成员关系；规范结构子句统一使用空神谕作为结构检查的实例。</li>\n<li>在配置和运行子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\">\\(O=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\)</span>；各分量是其唯一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,x\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w,x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>查询词谓词的配置参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\">\\((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\)</span>；所有带编号在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span> 内。原模型只给规范查询配置神谕后继，不规范查询配置既不是接受也不是拒绝。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\\)</span> 是候选三元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}\\)</span> 对全部包分量存在量化。在最后的编码记号子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span>，并声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{ocode},\\operatorname{odecode})\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{ocode},\\operatorname{odecode})\\)</span> 为其分量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl(\nO=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\mathbf 2\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}|=6\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl(\nO=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\mathbf 2\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}|=6\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr\\geq6\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq2\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land\\operatorname{OTM}_{\\varnothing}(O)\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr\\geq6\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq2\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land\\operatorname{OTM}_{\\varnothing}(O)\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{O:\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{O:\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge6}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\n\\exists P\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists e:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to\n\\{\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf v:\nq\\in\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\n\\land\\mathbf v\\in(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathbf q:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to\n\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathbf a:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nO=P\\land\\pi_1(P)=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\pi_3(P)=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\n(\\{\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf v:\nq\\in\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\n\\land\\mathbf v\\in(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\;\ne(i)=\\langle\\mathbf q(i)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf a(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\pi_5(P),\\pi_4(P),\\pi_7(P),\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P),\\pi_{11}(P),\\pi_{12}(P)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}}\n\\Bigl(\\bigl\\langle\\pi_1\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr\\rangle\\\\\n\\qquad\\mathbin{\\frown}\\bigl\\langle\n\\pi_j\\bigl(\\pi_2\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr):1\\le j\\le\\pi_5(P)\\bigr\\rangle\\\\\n\\qquad\\mathbin{\\frown}\\bigl\\langle\n\\iota\\bigl(\\pi_j\\bigl(\\pi_3\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\bigr):1\\le j\\le\\pi_5(P)\\bigr\\rangle\\Bigr)\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge6}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\n\\exists P\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists e:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to\n\\{\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf v:\nq\\in\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\n\\land\\mathbf v\\in(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathbf q:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to\n\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathbf a:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\to(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nO=P\\land\\pi_1(P)=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\pi_3(P)=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\n(\\{\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf v:\nq\\in\\pi_1(P)\\setminus\\{\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P)\\}\n\\land\\mathbf v\\in(\\pi_3(P))^{\\pi_5(P)}\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}\\}\\;\ne(i)=\\langle\\mathbf q(i)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathbf a(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\pi_5(P),\\pi_4(P),\\pi_7(P),\\pi_8(P),\\pi_9(P),\\pi_{10}(P),\\pi_{11}(P),\\pi_{12}(P)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^{\\pi_5(P)}}\n\\Bigl(\\bigl\\langle\\pi_1\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr\\rangle\\\\\n\\qquad\\mathbin{\\frown}\\bigl\\langle\n\\pi_j\\bigl(\\pi_2\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr):1\\le j\\le\\pi_5(P)\\bigr\\rangle\\\\\n\\qquad\\mathbin{\\frown}\\bigl\\langle\n\\iota\\bigl(\\pi_j\\bigl(\\pi_3\\bigl((\\pi_6(P))(\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf a(i))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\bigr):1\\le j\\le\\pi_5(P)\\bigr\\rangle\\Bigr)\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(O,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{otab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(O,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{otab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(e,c,d)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\n\\land c=\\{(O,e(\\operatorname{otab}(O))):O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land d=\\{(z,O)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}:(O,z)\\in c\\}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\n\\Bigl[\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(e,c,d)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\n\\land c=\\{(O,e(\\operatorname{otab}(O))):O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\n\\land d=\\{(z,O)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}:(O,z)\\in c\\}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\forall e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathcal G:\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal G)\\}\\;\\pi_1(\\mathcal F)=e\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\forall e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathcal G:\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal G)\\}\\;\\pi_1(\\mathcal F)=e\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in Q\\times(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\times\\mathbb Z^k:\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QueryWord}_O((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),x)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land q=q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\land x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(\\pi_k(\\mathbf T))(i)=x(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(\\pi_k(\\mathbf T))(i)=\\mathrm{blank}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{QueryWord}_O((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),x)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land q=q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\land x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(\\pi_k(\\mathbf T))(i)=x(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(\\pi_k(\\mathbf T))(i)=\\mathrm{blank}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrdinaryStep}_O(C,C&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\land C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T,\\mathbf T&#39;\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h,\\mathbf h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\nC=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\}\n\\land\\bigl((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\bigr)\\in\\delta\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D))))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrdinaryStep}_O(C,C&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\land C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T,\\mathbf T&#39;\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h,\\mathbf h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\nC=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\}\n\\land\\bigl((q,\\langle(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))(\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)):1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\bigr)\\in\\delta\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T&#39;)=(\\pi_j(\\mathbf T))[\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)\\mapsto \\pi_j(\\mathbf a)]\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h&#39;)=\\pi_j(\\mathbf h)+d(\\pi_j(\\mathbf D))))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nC\\to_O^B C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\nC\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\land C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{OrdinaryStep}_{O}(C,C&#39;)\n\\lor\\exists x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\left[\nC=(q_{\\mathsf{qry}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\n\\land\\operatorname{QueryWord}_O(C,x)\n\\land C&#39;=\n\\begin{cases}\n(q_{\\mathsf{yes}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),&amp;x\\in B,\\\\\n(q_{\\mathsf{no}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),&amp;x\\notin B\n\\end{cases}\n\\right]\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nC\\to_O^B C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\nC\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\land C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{OrdinaryStep}_{O}(C,C&#39;)\n\\lor\\exists x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\left[\nC=(q_{\\mathsf{qry}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\n\\land\\operatorname{QueryWord}_O(C,x)\n\\land C&#39;=\n\\begin{cases}\n(q_{\\mathsf{yes}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),&amp;x\\in B,\\\\\n(q_{\\mathsf{no}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),&amp;x\\notin B\n\\end{cases}\n\\right]\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nR_O^B\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\times\\operatorname{OConf}_O:C\\to_O^B C&#39;\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nR_O^B\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\times\\operatorname{OConf}_O:C\\to_O^B C&#39;\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,\\langle T_w\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle T_{\\mathrm{blank}}:2\\le j\\le k\\rangle,\\langle 0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nL^B(O)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\mathbf2^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\pi_1(C)=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^B))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nL^B(O)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\mathbf2^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\pi_1(C)=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^B))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\forall O\\in\\{P:\\operatorname{OTM}_B(P)\\}\\;\n\\exists O&#39;\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl[(w\\in L^B(O)\\leftrightarrow w\\in L^B(O&#39;))\n\\land(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OHalts}_{O&#39;}^B(w))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\forall O\\in\\{P:\\operatorname{OTM}_B(P)\\}\\;\n\\exists O&#39;\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl[(w\\in L^B(O)\\leftrightarrow w\\in L^B(O&#39;))\n\\land(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OHalts}_{O&#39;}^B(w))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ocode}(O)\n\\quad(O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ocode}(O)\n\\quad(O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>神谕程序的结构与具体神谕无关，而查询后的 yes/no 分支仍依赖固定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。表格中的各行约束用合取连接，不再让逗号或正文承担条件。</p>\n<p>查询带仍要求从零开始恰好写出二进制词，其余位置全为空白；不规范查询没有后继。查询动作保持带内容与读头位置，普通动作保持原来的左右移动。编码与反解采用内部有效元组接口，非法编码仍不表示程序。</p>\n<p>表格编码的单射性及给定有效元组编码时编码包的存在唯一性已写入 Assertion；固定编码包不是额外假定存在的未解释对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-local-t